Starting March 1, all employees will be required to change their passwords every ninety days. New passwords must contain at least twelve characters, {{1}} one number and one symbol. {{2}}, the system will now lock accounts after five failed login attempts.

These changes are part of our ongoing effort to protect company and client data. {{3}}

If you have any questions, please contact the help desk. We appreciate your {{4}} in keeping our systems secure.
